p022:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"難當","kind":"person","person_id":"g2n_d4n_mzr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"楊後起","kind":"person","person_id":"gxd_sho_nx7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p022:m0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"文弘","kind":"person","person_id":"zdb_1c5_ffp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-059","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete-ws1748911"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-059-western-polities-complete:p024","text":"世祖即位，進後起號冠軍將軍。永明元年，以征虜將軍炅為沙州刺史、陰平王，將軍如故。二年，八座奏，後起（勒）〔勤〕彰款塞，忠著邊城。進號征虜將軍。四年，後起卒，詔曰：「後起奄至殞逝，惻愴于懷。綏禦邊服，宜詳其選。行輔國將軍、北秦州刺史、武都王楊集始，幹局沈亮，乃心忠款，必能緝境寧民、宣揚聲教。可持節、輔國將軍、北秦州刺史、平羌校尉、武都王。」後起弟後明為龍驤將軍、白水太守。集始弟集朗為寧朔將軍。五年，有司奏集始驅狐剪棘，仰化邊服。母以子貴，宜加榮寵。除集始母姜氏為太夫人，假銀印。九年，八座奏，楊炅嗣勤西牧，馳款內昭，宜增戎章，用輝遐外。進號前將軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":59,"last_line":59,"raw_start":4210,"raw_end":4587,"raw_character_offsets":[4210,4211,4212,4213,4214,4215,4216,4217,4218,4219,4220,4221,4222,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4229,4230,4231,4232,4233,4234,4235,4236,4237,4238,4239,4240,4241,4242,4243,4244,4245,4246,4247,4248,4249,4250,4251,4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257,4258,4259,4260,4261,4262,4263,4264,4265,4266,4267,4268,4304,4305,4306,4307,4308,4309,4310,4311,4312,4313,4314,4315,4316,4317,4318,4319,4320,4321,4322,4323,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332,4333,4334,4335,4336,4337,4338,4406,4407,4408,4409,4410,4411,4412,4413,4414,4415,4416,4417,4418,4419,4420,4421,4422,4423,4424,4425,4426,4427,4428,4429,4430,4431,4432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439,4440,4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,4447,4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459,4460,4461,4462,4463,4464,4465,4466,4467,4468,4469,4470,4471,4472,4473,4474,4475,4476,4477,4478,4479,4480,44